answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123741" :question/id #uuid "20d27d4e-9ece-5633-8e10-bf16ba96deb1" :question/math-academy-id "q-123741" :question/problem "Let $R=[1,3]\\times [-2,-1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=10+y-3x.$ Further, let \n\n$$\nI={∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nbe the unique number such that over all rectangular partitions $P$ of $R,$ we have \n$L(f,P)\\,\\le I\\,\\le U(f,P),$\nwhere $L(f,P)$ and $U(f,P)$ are the corresponding lower and upper Riemann sums, and \n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\,.\n$$\n\nWhat expression is missing from the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x,y),$ the double integral of $f$ over a rectangular region $R$ is the unique number $I$ (if it exists) such that\n\n$$\nL(f,P)\\le I\\le U(f,P),\n$$\n\nover all partitions $P$ of $R,$ where the lower and upper sums respectively are given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j} \\\\ U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand ${m}_{ij}$ and ${M}_{ij}$ are the minimum and maximum values of $f$ respectively in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe need to compute $U(f,P).$ \n\nNotice that for all subregions ${R}_{ij},$ we have that\n\n- $f(x,y)=10+y-3x$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=10+y-3x$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top left corner* of each subregion. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{M}_{ij}=f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j})=10+{y}_{j}-3{x}_{i-1}\n$$\n\nand the upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(10+{y}_{j}-3{x}_{i-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $10+{y}_{j}-3{x}_{i-1}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123741/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "89023510-57f4-52f9-90ed-eae07f48f707"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123741"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123742/selection/c4aebe9f412b9c381427bbef3d106bee7ec64d5b06f36a17140ef958027f923b" :answer/id #uuid "0aa36fcf-f972-5192-8198-31079ee94b14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+2{y}_{j-1}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123742/selection/2a16da6629182d7395634f7181b9dad16ecf48909ea593b0a62961caf0a0e81a" :answer/id #uuid "6217b638-b09c-54e9-b510-9a6dd11f8901" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}^{2}+2{y}_{j-1}^{2}+{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123742/selection/9af7570e6c55c563880d3506c35d7e9f237ef5eca034d627a14ea54eb04026ec" :answer/id #uuid "3397af36-1ab8-52af-bab6-6c2f3cb2a130" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}^{2}+2{y}_{j}^{2}+{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123742/selection/0ae0b758802eda90bd99bf0c18c0d27c6bcd8ed08d0a28d4a8674da36cc7cd23" :answer/id #uuid "a89b1ec9-59ec-51e6-a923-018cbf486c78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}^{2}+2{y}_{j}^{2}+{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123742/selection/940f6e5a4d5504b847afa12ff0791a1919091b5bd659405d2f86940f3640ef38" :answer/id #uuid "70186d7b-ec0e-5ffc-8a9f-ab3270874850" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the options is correct" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123742/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "59fee703-3802-5536-a5c7-6840c6246bdc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123742/selection/c4aebe9f412b9c381427bbef3d106bee7ec64d5b06f36a17140ef958027f923b" :answer-field/choices ["q-123742/selection/c4aebe9f412b9c381427bbef3d106bee7ec64d5b06f36a17140ef958027f923b" "q-123742/selection/2a16da6629182d7395634f7181b9dad16ecf48909ea593b0a62961caf0a0e81a" "q-123742