otice that for all subregions ${R}_{ij},$ we have that\n\n- $f(x,y)=x+2y$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=x+2y$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. Therefore,\n\n$$\n{M}_{ij}=f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})={x}_{i}+2{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nand the upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i}+2{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is ${x}_{i}+2{y}_{j}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-123740/selection/a0300a31c33dc63e7df5b62e4f8dc13479d2a899dbf236302c6c1407a4fa3348" :answer/id #uuid "a13065b7-956f-53c1-adc4-a5ea1a5737d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}-8{y}_{j}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123740/selection/50bf6321d7c32958cd2941a517e6126206818b5c7afde325591a07a59dd034e6" :answer/id #uuid "ed5915cd-1dce-5e7b-a642-71517145c357" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}-8{y}_{j-1}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123740/selection/857a9ab29b6f1d04c5e7bd285bb601e0353d6d268d34ea9b6aaeb3d567d4607a" :answer/id #uuid "7f645aeb-a4dd-5789-a7a1-7965e0e92a95" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}-8{y}_{j-1}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123740/selection/940f6e5a4d5504b847afa12ff0791a1919091b5bd659405d2f86940f3640ef38" :answer/id #uuid "076e3d49-d886-539d-b1af-683ac74ab655" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the options is correct" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123740/selection/36d0a27095c89885507f811988a07c8df0d5437a3f0784e33ff30baf2f9ac1a6" :answer/id #uuid "4023e224-9660-51a0-9e21-5b7afe7882de" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}-8{y}_{j}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123740/selection" :answer-field/id #u